            "language": "epi-info-check-code",
            "source": "*** Epi Info AI space-time cluster entry Check Code tour\n*** Entry checks complement, but do not replace, CLUSTER analysis validation.\n\nPage Event\n  Before\n    ENABLE case_id event_date location_id syndrome\n  End-Before\nEnd-Page\n\nPage Location\n  Before\n    ENABLE latitude longitude\n  End-Before\nEnd-Page\n\nField location_id\n  After\n    IF NOT (location_id = (.) OR location_id = \"\") THEN\n      GOTO latitude\n    END-IF\n  End-After\nEnd-Field\n\nField latitude\n  After\n    IF latitude < -90 OR latitude > 90 THEN\n      HIGHLIGHT latitude\n      DIALOG \"Latitude must be between -90 and 90 decimal degrees.\" TITLETEXT=\"Coordinate review\"\n    ELSE\n      UNHIGHLIGHT latitude\n    END-IF\n  End-After\nEnd-Field\n\nField longitude\n  After\n    IF longitude < -180 OR longitude > 180 THEN\n      HIGHLIGHT longitude\n      DIALOG \"Longitude must be between -180 and 180 decimal degrees.\" TITLETEXT=\"Coordinate review\"\n    ELSE\n      UNHIGHLIGHT longitude\n    END-IF\n  End-After\nEnd-Field\n"
          }
        },
